\name{cellucid_history_save}
\alias{cellucid_history_save}
\title{Save the history in this browser}
\usage{
cellucid_history_save(viewer, content = "history", name, results = "include")
}
\arguments{
\item{viewer}{A viewer \code{\link{cellucid_view}()} or \code{\link{cellucid_serve}()} returned.}
\item{content}{history: the trackers and branches with their values; state: the current state only, without its history (one squashed step "Shared state"); steps: the steps only, no cells or values (a replay plan for any dataset). One of \code{"history"}, \code{"state"}, \code{"steps"}. Default \code{"history"}, the viewer's own.}
\item{name}{Its name; the dataset's name and the time when left out. Text (at least 1 character). Left out unless given (the viewer then chooses as its own control does).}
\item{results}{Analysis results: include them, or leave them out to compute again on open from their recorded inputs (smaller; always so for steps). One of \code{"include"}, \code{"recompute"}. Default \code{"include"}, the viewer's own.}
}
\value{
A \code{cellucid_action_request}, at once and invisibly: the action is sent now, or when the viewer's channel opens.
\code{\link{cellucid_action_result}(request)} returns its outcome: a list of \code{bytes}, \code{content}, \code{name}, \code{saved} (Its id (history_saved_list)), \code{steps}.
}
\description{
Keep the history (every tracker), the current state only, or the steps only as a named saved state of this browser (history_saved_list lists them; replay or load it later).
}
\details{
The viewer's action \code{history.save} (History). It acts outside the viewer's state and history (a file the person receives in the browser, a publication, or what the browser keeps for later visits), which Undo does not take back: it makes no step of the history.
}
\seealso{
\code{\link{cellucid_act}()} sends any action by its type, and \code{\link{cellucid_action_result}()}
collects its answer.
}
\examples{
if (interactive() && requireNamespace("SeuratObject", quietly = TRUE)) {
  data("pbmc_small", package = "SeuratObject")
  viewer <- cellucid_view(SeuratObject::UpdateSeuratObject(pbmc_small))
  request <- cellucid_history_save(viewer)
  print(request)
  # cellucid_action_result(request) waits for its outcome.
  cellucid_stop(viewer)
}
}
